{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32391","headline":"马嵬佛寺 · 温庭筠","name":"马嵬佛寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒鸡夜唱战尘深，五鼓雕舆过上林。\n才信倾城是真语，直敎涂地始甘心。\n两重秦苑成千里，一炷胡香抵万金。\n曼倩死来无绝艺，後人谁肯惜青禽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}